<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Sign in to Relisted</title>
  <style>
    body { margin: 0; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background: #f5f5f5; color: #111; padding: 24px; }
    .wrapper { max-width: 520px; margin: 0 auto; background: #fff; border-radius: 12px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); }
    .header { background: #000; color: #fff; padding: 24px; text-align: center; }
    .content { padding: 32px 24px; }
    .btn { display: inline-block; margin: 24px 0; padding: 14px 24px; background: #000; color: #fff !important; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 600; border-radius: 8px; }
    .footer { font-size: 12px; color: #777; padding: 16px 24px 24px; text-align: center; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="wrapper">
    <div class="header"><h1 style="margin:0;font-size:1.25rem;">Sign in to Relisted</h1></div>
    <div class="content">
      <p>Hi {{name}},</p>
      <p>We received a request to sign in to your Relisted account. Click the button below to continue.</p>
      <p style="text-align:center;"><a href="{{magicLink}}" class="btn">Sign in to Relisted</a></p>
      <p style="font-size:13px;color:#666;">This link expires in {{expiryMinutes}} minutes. If you did not request this email, you can ignore it.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="footer">&copy; {{year}} Relisted. All rights reserved.</div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
